{
  "esm": "2.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_ppm_limit_scale",
    "description": "The positive-definiteness limiter scale of the MOM6 PPM reconstruction (PPM_limit_pos, MOM_continuity_PPM.F90:2665-2677): with curv = mom6_ppm_curv = 3*((hL_raw + hR_raw) - 2*h_0), dh = mom6_ppm_dh = hR_raw - hL_raw, num = mom6_ppm_limit_scale_num = 12*curv*(h_0 - h_min_recon) and den = mom6_ppm_limit_scale_den = curv^2 + 3*dh^2, scale = num/den if curv > 0 and |dh| < curv and h_0 > h_min_recon and num < den; scale = 0 (the constant h_0 reconstruction) if h_0 <= h_min_recon; scale = 1 otherwise (the raw edges are kept). The limited edges are h_L = h_0 + scale*(h_L_raw - h_0) and h_R = h_0 + scale*(h_R_raw - h_0), applied by the sibling mom6_ppm_limited_edge. The h_min_recon floor is 2*GV%Angstrom_H (the reference run: h_min_recon = 2e-10 m). Pure scalar algebra, dimensionless.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:stencil", "family:mom6_cgrid", "grid:mom6_cgrid", "op:limit"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Colella, P., & Woodward, P. R. (1984). The Piecewise Parabolic Method (PPM) for gas-dynamical simulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 54(1), 174-201. (The positive-definiteness argument behind PPM_limit_pos.)",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(84)90143-8"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "./mom6_ppm_curv.esm" },
    { "ref": "./mom6_ppm_dh.esm" },
    { "ref": "./mom6_ppm_limit_scale_num.esm" },
    { "ref": "./mom6_ppm_limit_scale_den.esm" }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_ppm_limit_scale": {
      "params": ["hL_raw", "hR_raw", "h_0", "h_min_recon"],
      "description": "The PPM_limit_pos limiter scale of one cell (MOM_continuity_PPM.F90:2665-2677)",
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": ">",
            "args": [
              { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mom6_ppm_curv", "bindings": { "hL_raw": "hL_raw", "hR_raw": "hR_raw", "h_0": "h_0" } },
              0.0
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "<",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "abs",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mom6_ppm_dh", "bindings": { "hL_raw": "hL_raw", "hR_raw": "hR_raw" } }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mom6_ppm_curv", "bindings": { "hL_raw": "hL_raw", "hR_raw": "hR_raw", "h_0": "h_0" } }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "<=", "args": ["h_0", "h_min_recon"] },
                  0.0,
                  {
                    "op": "ifelse",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "<",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mom6_ppm_limit_scale_num", "bindings": { "hL_raw": "hL_raw", "hR_raw": "hR_raw", "h_0": "h_0", "h_min_recon": "h_min_recon" } },
                          { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mom6_ppm_limit_scale_den", "bindings": { "hL_raw": "hL_raw", "hR_raw": "hR_raw", "h_0": "h_0" } }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mom6_ppm_limit_scale_num", "bindings": { "hL_raw": "hL_raw", "hR_raw": "hR_raw", "h_0": "h_0", "h_min_recon": "h_min_recon" } },
                          { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mom6_ppm_limit_scale_den", "bindings": { "hL_raw": "hL_raw", "hR_raw": "hR_raw", "h_0": "h_0" } }
                        ]
                      },
                      1.0
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              1.0
            ]
          },
          1.0
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
